Origin of the code

  This repository is a fork of https://github.com/TeamRaccoons/WAGMI at commit
  fd36cc25b99848a02476156e8f7fcad8589e83de. The WAGMI README states that the
  project is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. A copy of that licence is in
  licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

  The WAGMI programs are in turn derived from earlier open source projects:

    programs/locked-voter   from Tribeca, https://github.com/TribecaHQ/tribeca   AGPL-3.0
    programs/govern         from Tribeca, https://github.com/TribecaHQ/tribeca   AGPL-3.0
    programs/smart-wallet   from Goki,    https://github.com/GokiProtocol/goki   AGPL-3.0
    libs/vipers             from Saber,   https://github.com/saber-hq/vipers     Apache-2.0

  Because three of the four components descend from AGPL-3.0 code, this fork and
  our changes to it are offered under AGPL-3.0. That licence can be satisfied
  whichever of the upstream licence statements applies.

